  "fullDescription": "Capture the simple beauty of blooming meadows with the Daisies & Daydreams Cottage Garden Clipart Collection. This delightful set includes 54 hand-painted watercolor PNG elements featuring cheerful daisies, charming wicker baskets overflowing with flowers, eucalyptus sprigs, delicate greenery, and botanical accents in soft cream, ivory, sage green, and warm golden tones.\n\nInspired by peaceful countryside gardens and slow cottage mornings, these illustrations are perfect for creating scrapbook layouts, junk journals, greeting cards, planner pages, stickers, sublimation designs, farmhouse décor, stationery, and handmade gifts. The soft watercolor textures and timeless botanical style make this collection ideal for spring, summer, cottagecore, and vintage-inspired projects.\n\nEach illustration is provided as a high-resolution 300 DPI PNG with a transparent background, allowing you to effortlessly mix, match, and layer elements to create beautiful floral arrangements, borders, and custom designs.\n\nWhether you’re crafting cozy journal pages, designing floral stationery, or creating products for your small business, this collection brings warmth, charm, and garden-inspired elegance to every project.\n\nIncluded:\n54 Individual PNG Files\nTransparent Backgrounds\nHigh Resolution 300 DPI\nWatercolor Daisy & Botanical Illustrations\nWicker Baskets, Greenery & Floral Elements\nCommercial Use Friendly\nPerfect For:\nScrapbooking\nJunk Journals\nGreeting Cards\nPlanner Decorations\nSticker Design\nSublimation Projects\nPrintable Wall Art\nStationery Design\nFarmhouse Décor\nDIY Crafts\nSmall Business Products\n\nBring the peaceful charm of blooming daisies and cottage gardens to your next creative project with this elegant watercolor clipart collection.",
